# A56 h02-info (from measurement-2026-09-17-h02/method/run2.actions, plus the
# '1206 move 300 300' leave-the-bar step of quit2/tera-move: parking at (0,0) puts
# the pointer on the menu bar, and the hover drop-down would eat the double-click).
# run2: the H02 sequence. Open C: window, select HELLO.TXT (220,340) -> A,
# hover File (88,8) -> B, move to "Info..." (110,43), click -> C (immediately), D (3 s later).
1200 park
1206 move 300 300
1400 move 195 35
1600 down
1603 up
1608 down
1611 up
2000 move 220 340
2200 arm
2210 down
2216 up
2400 mark A_SELECTED
2800 move 88 8
3000 mark B_MENU_OPEN
3400 move 110 43
3600 mark B2_ITEM_HOVER
3800 down
3801 mark C0_PRESSED
3806 up
3807 mark C1_RELEASED
3900 mark C2_HALF_SECOND
4400 mark D_THREE_SECONDS
